==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|electromagnetic spectra}}

# {{lb|en|physics}} The entire [[range]] of [[wavelengths]] of all known [[electromagnetic radiation]]s extending from [[gamma rays]] through [[visible light]], [[infrared]], and [[radio wave|radio waves]], to [[X-ray|X-rays]].
